@character rogue
@water 0
@lectern {"cell":[1,1,1],"text":"Round rock gallery\n\nPush the four round rocks east from the left bank. Try the rows from top to bottom.\n\nThe first rock skips to the far shore and stops on the first ground tile.\n\nThe second meets a wall. It sinks in the water just before the wall and becomes a stepping stone.\n\nThe third picks up a lily pad and rides it toward the far bank at a quarter of skipping speed. The pad stops in the last water tile before the bank, with the rock staying on top.\n\nThe fourth passes beside a pad. Its wake sends that pad north, perpendicular to the rock, at the same slow pad speed. It stops in the last water tile before the bank or when blocked.\n\nUse <!Undo!> or <!Restart!> to try again."}
